All-wheel drive 3 The last campaign – the long-awaited sequel to the cult driving simulator from Russian developers. The All-Wheel Drive game series gave users the opportunity to drive on unpredictable off-road terrain, traverse swamps and forests, and discover just how unique Russian vehicles can be and test their durability. Now, you'll witness another test, taking place in Australia.

If you decide to download All-Wheel Drive 3: The Last Campaign via torrent, you'll encounter eucalyptus forests that cleverly confuse even the most sophisticated GPS. Don't miss out on the thrill of driving through mudflats that can suck your car under at any opportunity. Or do you prefer endless plains? All of this awaits you in the new installment of the renowned game, which, in addition to a new location, adds improved car models, new parts for installations, and tweaks to the gameplay.

Game features:
- in addition to Australia, you can also explore the routes of Thailand and Ladoga, which are not inferior in originality and difficulty of development;
- the game features five new SUVs with their own features;
- don't miss the opportunity to compete with your friends in online multiplayer for up to 4 people;
- expanded car tuning options, from choosing wheels to enhancing the aesthetic appearance of your "steel" horse;
- an improved damage system that takes into account not only damage to the vehicle's external frame, but also internal unpleasant damage;
- added the ability to completely change the controls to suit your needs.

